---
import { smartCityUrl } from '../../data/smart-city-media';
---
<section id="polevolt" class="chapter">
      <div class="polevolt-editorial">
        <div class="polevolt-introduction">
          <div class="chapter-copy">
            <p class="chapter-meta"><span>05</span><strong><small>Smart infrastructure</small></strong></p>
            <h2>PoleVolt</h2>
            <h3>From smart screens to smart infrastructure.</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="polevolt-summary">
            <p>Working with Duke Energy, UNC Charlotte, the City of Charlotte and the Centralina Regional Council, CityPost became part of a curbside experience integrating EV charging directly into light poles.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="media-slot polevolt-feature-photo">
          <img src={smartCityUrl("polevolt-kt-port.webp") ?? "/images/media-placeholder.svg"} alt="PoleVolt EV charger mounted to a light pole beside a parked electric vehicle" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>
